Package: ghatools
Title: Shared Helpers for the Reusable Checks in This Repository
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Douglas Ezra", "Morrison", , "demorrison@ucdavis.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Logic shared by the R-based checks in this repository: parsing a
    unified diff into the lines it adds, extracting prose from Quarto and
    Markdown sources, and detecting the AI tells catalogued in ai-config's
    shared/writing/ai-tells.md. The check-* directories hold thin command-line
    wrappers; the logic they share lives here so it is written, tested, and
    fixed once rather than copied per check.
